  "settingsLegalInShort": "In short",
  "settingsLegalReadTerms": "Read the Terms of Use",
  "settingsLegalReadPrivacy": "Read the Privacy Policy",
  "settingsPrivacyWhoTitle": "Who we are",
  "settingsPrivacyWho": "Prostuti (প্রস্তুতি) is a preparation app for BCS, bank and other government job exams in Bangladesh. This policy explains what information the app collects, why we collect it, who it is shared with and the choices you have. By using Prostuti you agree to this policy.",
  "settingsPrivacyCollectTitle": "Information you give us",
  "settingsPrivacyCollect": "• Account: your email address and password. Passwords are handled by our sign-in provider and stored only in hashed form — we can never see them.\n• Profile: your name, optional username, photo, bio, district, education, occupation, target exams, exam date and daily study time.\n• Onboarding interview: your answers about your education, background, institution, strong and weak subjects, study habits and challenges, plus your date of birth if you choose to give it.\n• Community: posts, comments, reactions, photos, friend requests, chat messages and images, reports you submit and people you block.\n• Support: the emails you send us.",
  "settingsPrivacyActivityTitle": "Information created as you use Prostuti",
  "settingsPrivacyActivity": "• Exams and practice: your answers, scores, time taken, wrong answers, bookmarks, subject levels and readiness.\n• Study plan: your routine, progress, streaks and the daily advice written for you.\n• Daily exam standing: your score and rank among all participants. Other users never see your name with your score — only anonymous scores.\n• Settings: language, theme, reminder time and notification preferences.\n• Feature use: how often you use AI features and promo codes, so that daily limits and plans work.",
  "settingsPrivacyDeviceTitle": "Device and technical information",
  "settingsPrivacyDevice": "• Error reports: if the app crashes or hits an error, it sends a technical report — the error message, a code-level stack trace, the screen in use, app version, operating system details and language — linked to your account. Email addresses, phone numbers and sign-in tokens are masked before sending. Reports are deleted after 30 days.\n• Push token: if push notifications are enabled in your version of the app, a device token is stored with your account.\n• Our servers log basic request information (such as IP address and time) for security and to prevent abuse.",
  "settingsPrivacyUseTitle": "How we use your information",
  "settingsPrivacyUse": "• To run the app: your account, exams, plans, community and chat.\n• To personalise your preparation: your answers and results shape your study plan, weak-topic practice and daily advice.\n• To keep the community safe: moderation, reports, blocking and usage limits.\n• To fix bugs and improve question quality.\nWe never sell your personal data, and we don't build advertising profiles from it.",
  "settingsPrivacyAiTitle": "AI features (OpenAI)",
  "settingsPrivacyAi": "Some features send text to OpenAI's API, which processes it on our behalf:\n• Daily notes and the daily exam are generated from public news articles — no personal data is involved.\n• Answer explanations: the question you asked about.\n• Onboarding interview: your interview answers (not your name, email, phone number or date of birth), to ask follow-up questions and build your learner profile.\n• Study plan tips and daily advice: your learner profile and a summary of your recent progress (weak topics, results, streak, days left).\n• Community safety: the text of new posts and comments is checked automatically for abuse.\nWe don't send your email, password or phone number to OpenAI. Under OpenAI's API data policy this data is not used to train their models and is kept for a limited time (up to 30 days) for abuse monitoring. AI output can be wrong — please report mistakes.",
  "settingsPrivacyAdsTitle": "Advertising (Google AdMob)",
  "settingsPrivacyAds": "Prostuti shows rewarded ads only when you choose to watch one (for example, to download a note). Ads are provided by Google AdMob. The Google Mobile Ads SDK, which starts with the app, may collect your device's advertising ID, IP address, device information and ad interactions to deliver and measure ads, prevent fraud and, where allowed, show personalised ads. You can reset your advertising ID or opt out of ad personalisation in your phone's settings (Settings → Google → Ads, or Privacy → Ads on some phones). Learn more: policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites",
  "settingsPrivacyNotifTitle": "Notifications",
  "settingsPrivacyNotif": "Study reminders and the morning routine are scheduled on your phone and work without internet. In-app notifications (friend requests, comments, messages, results) are stored with your account. Where push notifications are enabled, they are delivered through Google Firebase Cloud Messaging. You control every category in Settings → Notifications and in your phone's settings.",
  "settingsPrivacySharingTitle": "Who can see your information",
  "settingsPrivacySharing": "• Other Prostuti users: your profile (name, username, photo, bio, district, education, occupation, target exams and activity such as streaks), and your posts, comments and reactions. Profile photos and post images are stored at links that anyone with the link can open. Your date of birth is visible only to you. Messages are visible only to the people in that conversation.\n• Our team: authorised admins and moderators, when needed to handle reports, support requests and safety issues.\n• Service providers that process data for us: Supabase (hosting, database, sign-in and file storage), OpenAI (AI features) and Google (AdMob ads and, where enabled, Firebase push).\n• Authorities, only when the law requires it.\nWe do not sell or rent your personal data.",
  "settingsPrivacyStorageTitle": "Storage and security",
  "settingsPrivacyStorage": "Your data is stored with Supabase in the AWS Asia Pacific (Mumbai, India) region (ap-south-1), which is outside Bangladesh. All traffic is encrypted (HTTPS/TLS). Database rules make sure your private data — plans, results, messages and personal details — can be read only by you (and, when needed, our team). On your phone, Prostuti keeps a cache of downloaded content for offline use and your sign-in session; these are excluded from phone backups and device-to-device transfers. Screenshots and screen recording are blocked inside the app to protect exam content.",
  "settingsPrivacyRetentionTitle": "How long we keep data",
  "settingsPrivacyRetention": "We keep your account data for as long as your account exists. Error reports are deleted after 30 days, daily advice after 14 days and usage-limit counters after 2 days. Content you delete is removed from the app; deleted chat messages are hidden from the conversation and erased for good when the account is deleted. Records that can no longer identify you, such as overall usage statistics, may be kept.",
  "settingsPrivacyChoicesTitle": "Your choices and rights",
  "settingsPrivacyChoices": "• View and edit your profile at any time (Settings → Edit profile).\n• Choose who can message you, block people and report content.\n• Turn each notification category on or off.\n• Clear cached data from this phone (Settings → Clear cache) or log out.\n• Ask for a copy of your data or a correction by emailing {email}.",
  "@settingsPrivacyChoices": {
    "placeholders": { "email": { "type": "String" } }
  },
  "settingsPrivacyDeleteTitle": "Deleting your account",
  "settingsPrivacyDelete": "Go to Settings → Account → Request account deletion. The app opens an email to our support team with your username and user ID filled in; send it from the email address you signed up with (or write to {email}). Once we confirm the request is yours, we permanently delete your account and its data — profile, private details, exam and practice history, study plans, posts, comments, messages and notifications — within 30 days. Error reports are unlinked from your account immediately and deleted within 30 days; backups kept by our hosting provider expire on their normal schedule.",
  "@settingsPrivacyDelete": {
    "placeholders": { "email": { "type": "String" } }
  },
  "settingsPrivacyChildrenTitle": "Children",
  "settingsPrivacyChildren": "Prostuti is meant for students and job seekers preparing for competitive exams. It is not directed at children under 13, and we don't knowingly collect their data. If you believe a child has created an account, contact us and we will delete it.",
  "settingsPrivacyChangesTitle": "Changes to this policy",
  "settingsPrivacyChanges": "We may update this policy as the app changes. We'll change the date at the top and, for important changes, tell you in the app before they take effect.",
  "settingsPrivacyContactTitle": "Contact",
  "settingsPrivacyContact": "Questions or requests about your privacy: {email}",
  "@settingsPrivacyContact": {
    "placeholders": { "email": { "type": "String" } }
  },
  "settingsTermsAcceptTitle": "Agreement",
  "settingsTermsAccept": "These Terms of Use govern your use of Prostuti. By creating an account or using the app you agree to them and to our Privacy Policy. If you don't agree, please don't use Prostuti.",
  "settingsTermsAccountTitle": "Your account",
  "settingsTermsAccount": "• You must be at least 13 years old; if you are under 18, use Prostuti with a parent's or guardian's permission.\n• Give accurate information and keep your password secret. You are responsible for what happens under your account.\n• One account per person. Don't impersonate anyone or create accounts to get around limits or bans.",
  "settingsTermsStudyAidTitle": "A study aid, not an official source",
  "settingsTermsStudyAid": "Prostuti helps you prepare; it does not guarantee any exam result. Questions come from previous exams, books, newspapers and AI generation; current-affairs notes and explanations are written with AI from public news. Despite our checks, content can contain mistakes. Always confirm exam dates, syllabi and notices with BPSC or the relevant authority. If you find an error, please report it.",
  "settingsTermsCommunityTitle": "Community rules",
  "settingsTermsCommunity": "Be respectful. Do not post or send:\n• harassment, threats, hate speech or sexual content;\n• spam, scams or advertising;\n• leaked question papers, cheating material or content you don't have the right to share;\n• other people's personal information, or anything illegal.\nPosts and comments are checked automatically and may be hidden. We may remove content and limit, suspend or close accounts that break these rules. Use Report and Block to help keep Prostuti safe.",
  "settingsTermsYourContentTitle": "Your content",
  "settingsTermsYourContent": "You own what you post. By posting, you give Prostuti a non-exclusive, royalty-free licence to store, display and deliver it inside the app so the service can work. You are responsible for your content and confirm that you have the right to share it. You can delete your posts and comments at any time.",
  "settingsTermsOurContentTitle": "Our content and fair use",
  "settingsTermsOurContent": "The question bank, notes, explanations, study plans and app design belong to Prostuti or its licensors. You may use them for your own non-commercial preparation. Do not copy, sell or republish them; do not scrape the app, get around screenshot protection, reverse-engineer the app, abuse limits or automate access; and do not disrupt the service or other users.",
  "settingsTermsPlansTitle": "Plans, add-ons and ads",
  "settingsTermsPlans": "Some features are free with daily limits; others need an add-on. New accounts may receive a free trial. Add-ons last for the period shown and do not renew automatically. Promo codes are personal, can be redeemed once per account and have no cash value. Some actions can be unlocked by watching a rewarded ad. We may change which features are free or paid; add-ons you already have keep running until they end.",
  "settingsTermsAvailabilityTitle": "Availability and changes",
  "settingsTermsAvailability": "We work to keep Prostuti running, but it is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\". Features may change, pause for maintenance or be discontinued. Some features need an internet connection.",
  "settingsTermsLiabilityTitle": "Limitation of liability",
  "settingsTermsLiability": "To the extent the law allows, Prostuti is not liable for indirect or consequential losses, for exam outcomes or for decisions you make based on app content. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under law that cannot be excluded.",
  "settingsTermsEndTitle": "Ending your use",
  "settingsTermsEnd": "You can stop using Prostuti at any time and request deletion of your account from Settings. We may suspend or close accounts that break these terms or put others at risk.",
  "settingsTermsLawTitle": "Governing law",
  "settingsTermsLaw": "These terms are governed by the laws of Bangladesh.",
  "settingsTermsChangesTitle": "Changes to these terms",
  "settingsTermsChanges": "We may update these terms. We'll change the date at the top and tell you in the app about important changes. If you keep using Prostuti after a change, you accept the updated terms.",
  "settingsTermsContactTitle": "Contact",
  "settingsTermsContact": "Questions about these terms: {email}",
